sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist / Client
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Admission Webhooks<br/>HTTPS TLS
    participant Operator as KubeRay Operator<br/>/manager
    participant HeadPod as Ray Head Pod
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant Gateway as Gateway API<br/>HTTPRoute
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 1: Cluster Creation & Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayCluster CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission Review<br/>mutating + validating
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Approved (mutated)
    K8sAPI-->>User: RayCluster created

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: RayCluster created
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Head Pod, Worker Pods
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create Services, Secrets
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy (isolation)

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 2: Authenticated Dashboard Access

    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount for cluster
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Inject kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>into Head Pod (port 8443)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoute + ReferenceGrant

    User->>Gateway: GET /dashboard<br/>Bearer Token (OIDC/OAuth)
    Gateway->>KRBP: Forward via HTTPRoute<br/>TLS
    KRBP->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Authenticated & Authorized
    KRBP->>HeadPod: Proxy to Ray Dashboard
    HeadPod-->>KRBP: Dashboard Response
    KRBP-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Dashboard HTML

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 3: mTLS Certificate Lifecycle

    Operator->>CertMgr: Create Issuer CR
    Operator->>CertMgr: Create Certificate CR<br/>(inter-node mTLS)
    CertMgr-->>K8sAPI: Issue TLS cert → Secret
    K8sAPI-->>HeadPod: Mount TLS Secret

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 4: Job Submission

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayJob CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate RayJob
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Approved
    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch event: RayJob created
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/reuse RayCluster
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create batch/v1 Job<br/>(submitter)
    Operator->>HeadPod: Submit Ray job via dashboard API

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 5: Metrics & Health

    Prometheus->>Operator: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    Operator-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics
